Audited 64 intrinsic Gaussian boundary theorem declarations; only the permitted three axioms.
The exact coefficient-two boundary inequality is discharged from actual Gaussian Stein, softmax convergence, and genuine C1 ramps. No covariance gap, invertibility, distinct-row, or desired-concentration premise is assumed.
